			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120200401,
					"content": "唉，珊瑚宮大人到底是怎麼想的，怎麼能同意和談呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉久"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200402,
					"content": "是啊…天領奉行那些傢伙根本不值得相信，我還聽說天領奉行的人秘密勾結愚人眾，打算繼續與我們作戰呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恆雄"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200403,
					"content": "真的假的？消息可靠嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉久"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200404,
					"content": "當然是真的，我們的人與愚人眾交手，正好撞見了他們正在密謀這件事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恆雄"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200405,
					"content": "我就知道，天領奉行那幫傢伙賊心不死…珊瑚宮大人還是有點天真，怎麼能輕易相信他們呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉久"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200406,
					"content": "噓，小點聲，有人來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恆雄"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200407,
					"content": "你們在說什麼呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200408,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}隊長？{F#妳}{M#你}回來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200409,
						120200410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉久"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200409,
					"content": "與你們一起開慶功會。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200411
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120200411,
					"content": "我說，剛剛的事情，能跟隊長說嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉久"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200412,
					"content": "#還是不要吧。{F#她}{M#他}也是珊瑚宮大人提拔起來的，說不定也主張和談…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恆雄"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200413,
					"content": "隊長應該理解我們吧？不過小心一點也有道理…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉久"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200414,
					"content": "那個，歡迎隊長回海祇島！我們這邊沒什麼事，一切安好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉久"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200415,
					"content": "珊瑚宮大人現在應該在村莊裡，隊長大人可以直接過去！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恆雄"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200416,
					"content": "唔…總覺得他們好像在聊什麼秘密的事情。不過既然他們不肯說，我們還是先去村子裡看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120200410,
					"content": "最近發生了什麼事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120200411
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
